    "study.problema.a-ordem-importa-os": "<strong>Order matters.</strong> The modules in a learning path unlock in sequence, from the video lesson to the final assessment. <span class=\"tag tag--doc\">Design</span>",
    "study.problema.esforco-real-vale-mais": "<strong>Real effort counts more than intention.</strong> Progress, hours, and streak come from logged focus sessions, not from items checked off by hand. <span class=\"tag tag--doc\">Design</span>",
