    "study.implementacao.design-de-produto-telas": "Product design, screens in Figma, the design system, and the interface decisions described in this case study. This is the part I own. The app credits “Design System by Gabriel Rocha”.",
    "study.implementacao.conteudo-gerado-dentro-do": "Content generated inside the product",
    "study.implementacao.quem-gera-a-jornada": "When someone uses the app, the learning path, reading, quiz, and flashcards are generated by the Gemini API. That is the AI inside the product.",
    "study.implementacao.escrita-do-codigo": "Writing the code",
    "study.implementacao.este-case-ainda-nao": "This case study doesn’t yet record how the code was written or with which tools. Until that is documented, the section above describes what exists in the code without attributing it to me.",
    "study.implementacao.desafios-tecnicos": "Technical challenges",
    "study.implementacao.respostas-de-ia-nem": "<strong>AI responses don’t always arrive in the expected format.</strong> The server validates each response before delivering it: the quiz needs 10 questions with one correct answer, flashcards must number between 4 and 12, the learning path requires at least two study modules plus a final review and a final assessment, and the reading must have at least 60 words. When a response fails, the server retries and falls back through a chain of alternative models.",
    "study.implementacao.cota-tempo-e-custo": "<strong>Quota, time, and cost.</strong> AI calls go into a queue (two at a time, up to 40 waiting) and have a budget of 38 seconds per request. Responses are cached for 24 hours, and an older response can be reused for up to 14 days if the service fails. There is a per-IP rate limit.",
    "study.implementacao.videos-adequados-a-busca": "<strong>Relevant videos.</strong> The YouTube search returns five videos per topic and applies blocked-word and educational-term filters to reduce off-topic results.",
    "study.implementacao.entradas-do-usuario-dentro": "<strong>User input inside a prompt.</strong> Text the learner types is sanitized and escaped before it goes into the prompts sent to the AI.",
    "study.ia.api-do-gemini": "Gemini API",
    "study.ia.gera-a-jornada-de": "Generates the module path, the reading text, the quiz, the flashcards, and the summary for each subject.",
    "study.ia.api-de-dados-do": "YouTube Data API",
    "study.ia.busca-e-filtra-as": "Searches for and filters the video lessons for each topic.",
    "study.ia.identifica-a-pessoa-no": "Identifies the user in the browser through Google’s identity service.",
    "study.ia.as-chaves-das-apis": "API keys are kept on the server, in environment variables, never in the browser.",
    "study.ia.o-conteudo-gerado-nao": "Generated content isn’t reviewed by a human. The validators guarantee format, not accuracy: well-formatted text can still contain errors.",
    "study.demo.o-study-esta-no": "Study is live and available to try. Before opening it, it’s worth knowing its limits.",
